{"suttaId":"tha-ap520","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[3337,3357],"vripara":"44"},"segments":{"tha-ap520:0.3":"Ghosasaññakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap520:1.1":"“Migaluddo pure āsiṃ, araññe vipine ahaṃ;","tha-ap520:1.3":"Addasaṃ virajaṃ buddhaṃ, devasaṅghapurakkhataṃ.","tha-ap520:2.1":"“Catusaccaṃ pakāsentaṃ, desentaṃ amataṃ padaṃ;","tha-ap520:2.3":"Assosiṃ madhuraṃ dhammaṃ, sikhino lokabandhuno.","tha-ap520:3.1":"“Ghose cittaṃ pasādesiṃ, asamappaṭipuggale;","tha-ap520:3.3":"Tattha cittaṃ pasādetvā, uttariṃ [atariṃ (sī. pī.)] duttaraṃ bhavaṃ.","tha-ap520:4.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ saññamalabhiṃ tadā;","tha-ap520:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, ghosasaññāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap520:5.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap520:6.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap520:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap520:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ghosasaññako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap520:9.1":"Ghosasaññakattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
